22. How to Run the Project
Step 1: Install Required Libraries
pip install -r requirements.txt
Step 2: Load Dataset into SQLite
python SQL/load_data_to_sql.py
Step 3: Run SQL Analysis
python SQL/run_sql_analysis.py
Step 4: Run Predictive Model
python Model/predictive_model.py
Step 5: Run Model Comparison
python Model/model_comparison.py
Step 6: Generate Feature Importance
python Model/feature_importance.py
Step 7: Prepare Dashboard Data
python Dashboard/dashboard_data.py
Step 8: Open Power BI

Open Microsoft Power BI Desktop and load the prepared files from:

Dashboard/Data/

