24. Limitations

The current project has the following limitations:

Prediction performance depends on the quality and characteristics of the available dataset.
External factors such as market conditions, promotions, competitors, and economic conditions are not included.
Customer behavior can change over time.
The implemented models may not capture every complex relationship within e-commerce sales.
Model performance depends on the available features and data distribution.
Predictions should be interpreted together with business context.

